{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Speed is Survival</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fine-tuned movement system enables precise and agile movement. With hordes of enemies targeting you from all directions and perilous falls around every corner, a well-timed slide or grapple can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/TUT_GIF_small.gif?t=1744505023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Defeat Powerful Foes</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face uniquely designed enemies with powerful weapons. Whether you\u2019re cracking skulls with the revolver or mowing down groups with the SMG, there\u2019s always a new way to lay waste to your robotic adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/Combat_GIF_SMALL.gif?t=1744505023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Upgrade and Adapt</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new upgrades and weapons in the shop. Fine tune your kit to suit your playstyle or experiment with a new arsenal for a fresh run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/Store_GIF_SMALL.gif?t=1744505023\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468230?t=1744505023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468230?t=1744505023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744505023","cap